          "kind": "action",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Match cut: the same little hand that held Suman's in the field reaches for one piece of गुड़. The boy is wrapped in Devendra's checked shirt, sleeves rolled up twice. He offers the piece to Devendra before taking one for himself. Devendra accepts. The boy smiles at him, then at Suman.",
